REVSTR - adds a string-function keyword:  a$ = REVERSE$("abc").

Language features
  - SEED_KEYWORD (SEED_KW_STRFN, name ends in $)
  - a seed that returns a STRING (set_return_str), read as a$ = REVERSE$(...)

Try it
  PRINT REVERSE$("berry")      -> yrreb

Build it on the machine
  grow revstr          # -> build/REVSTR.SED
It is also prebuilt in /SEED as REVSTR.SED, ready to use.

